taw na7a gidana” gidee?","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["Qassi Xoossay ba bayra Na7aa ha alamiya kiittishe,",{"text":"“Xoossaa kiitanchchoti ubbay iyaw goynno”","poem":1},"yaagis."]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["Xoossay kiitanchchotabaa odishe,",{"text":"“Xoossay ba Kiitanchchota carkko,","poem":1},{"text":"ba aylleta tama laco oothees”","poem":2},"yaagees."]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["Shin ba Na7abaa odishe,",{"text":"“Xoossaw, ne kawotethay merinaw de7ees.","poem":1},{"text":"Ne kawotethaa ne xillotethan ayssasa.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Neeni xillotethi dosadasa; iita ixxadasa.","poem":1},{"text":"Xoossay, ne Goday, nena ne laggetappe aathidi dooris,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ufayssa zayte","poem":2},{"noteId":2},{"text":"nena tiyis”","poem":2},"yaagees."]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["Xoossay Zaaridi,",{"text":"“Godaw, koyro neeni sa7aa medhdhadasa;","poem":1},{"text":"saloti ne kushe ooso.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"Hessati ubbay dhayana;","poem":1},{"text":"shin neeni daana.","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Entti ubbay afilada wurana.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"Neeni entta salenaada xaaxana;","poem":1},{"text":"qassi entti afilada laamettana.","poem":2},{"text":"Shin neeni ubba wode nena;","poem":1},{"text":"ne laythayka wurenna”","poem":2},"yaagees."]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["Shin Xoossay kiitanchchotappe ooddeko,",{"text":"“Taani ne morkketa ne tohoy","poem":1},{"text":"yedhdhiyaso oothana gakkanaw,","poem":2},{"text":"hayssan taappe ushachcha baggan utta” gidee?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["Kiitanchchoti ubbay atotethi demmanaw de7iya asata maaddanaw Xoossay kiittida ayyaanata gidokkonaayye?"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"ufayssa zayte: I kawotiya wode asay ufayssan ililidi iya kawotheyssa bessees.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gof_tbl/HEB/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_tbl/HEB/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_tbl/PHM/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}